                "text": "Wyoming\u2019s rural hospitals understand best what their own patients and communities need.\n\u00a0\nOur legislation will give America\u2019s rural hospitals the flexibility they need to keep their doors open and freedom from one-size-fits-all Washington regulations.\nhttps://t.co/55fsKtSIbM",
