                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Senate just passed our #RuralHealthDay resolution honoring health care providers who serve patients across rural America.\n\u00a0\nFrontier hospitals in Wyoming have a long record of providing patients in rural areas with the care they need close to home.\nhttps://t.co/MK2CcOf33v",
