                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Wyoming's hospitals see more Medicaid and low-income visitors than other states, yet we\u2019re often left behind on funding.\n\u00a0\nThis bill will ensure America's rural hospitals get the support they deserve and can keep providing care to those who need it most.\nhttps://t.co/HPH8nVjAZW",
