                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Making America healthy is a goal that @RobertKennedyJr and I share. We had a productive discussion on rural health challenges, combatting the chronic disease epidemic, and protecting patients from one-size-fits-all government mandates. I look forward to his confirmation hearing. https://t.co/ubt7fSiaRG",
