                "retweet_count": 14,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Wyoming\u2019s hospitals serve more Medicaid and low-income patients than other states, but our share of funding hasn\u2019t caught up for decades. Our rural hospitals are fighting to keep their doors open while we've been overlooked for our fair share.\n\nThis bipartisan bill will fix outdated funding issues for hospitals across Wyoming and rural America.\nhttps://t.co/an8yPTiP4a",
