                "text": "Since Obamacare became law, over 100 rural hospitals across the country have closed. Only 10 new ones have opened. \n\nThe One Big Beautiful Bill created a $50 Billion rural hospital fund to address this crisis. https://t.co/it4G7eHH9A",
